    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84417.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "How do you cope with it? Because, well, isn't just about money. It's about craving a life where you thrive and help others do the same. Listen to the Well Break podcast on the iHeartRadio app.",
