        "text": "Audience members value the host's acknowledgment of their presence and contribution.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Regular viewers expect continuity and consistency in the show's format and presentation.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Being voted on annually reflects legitimacy and public approval within the context of the show.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience understands and accepts the humorous framing of the voting process as part of the show’s persona.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The host’s self-deprecating tone enhances credibility and rapport with the audience.",
