    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 84417,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84417.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "And that's seriously, how are you? I mean, when I talk to members of Congress, whether it's the House or the Senate, I mean that sincerely because I can't get my mind around how difficult it must be to have to find a way to plug into that. maneuver within it, and then extract yourself with all your brain cells intact.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_07",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "I sincerely mean what I say when I ask 'how are you?' during conversations with members of Congress.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Members of Congress face extremely challenging circumstances in their work environment.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "It is difficult to navigate the political system of Congress effectively.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Exiting the congressional environment without losing mental clarity is exceptionally hard.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that emotional well-being and cognitive integrity are valuable outcomes worth preserving.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that being mentally intact after engaging with Congress reflects a significant personal achievement.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views Congress as a high-pressure, cognitively demanding institution.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts their own judgment about the difficulty faced by members of Congress.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker expects the recipient to value sincerity and empathy in interpersonal interactions.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 84417,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84417.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "Well, I would tell you sincerely, but it might depress your listeners. I'll tell you, just obviously everybody watched what happened the day that we left DC and the votes that went down and the things that happened and you know I damn near cried on the house floor I'm watching my country slowly die in front of me and it feels like you're a little bit alone in trying to save it and so it's frustrating it's maddening it can be a little bit depressing but I think we need a lot of happy warriors who can withstand all this negativity and that's a huge part of it because it's just DC is designed to drag you down. It is literally a place that sucks the life force out of you. And so it's nice to be back in Florida. I'm sitting outside and having a cup of coffee, getting ready for the day. And it just reminds me of what we're fighting for. Truly.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "I would tell you sincerely if it were not for the potential emotional impact on your listeners.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Many people watched the events that occurred on the day we left DC.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker was emotionally overwhelmed by the political developments witnessed during their time in DC.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker felt isolated in their efforts to preserve the nation.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "DC is described as a place that systematically drains individuals' energy and morale.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Returning to Florida provides emotional rejuvenation and clarity.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker is currently physically present in Florida, enjoying a quiet morning ritual involving coffee.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "The listener values emotional well-being and may be sensitive to distressing narratives.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Emotional authenticity in political discourse carries moral weight and responsibility.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Political institutions like DC are inherently corrosive to idealism and personal vitality.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a collective national crisis requiring sustained resistance and hope.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Personal resilience depends on physical and environmental context, especially distance from political centers.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Happy warriors—individuals maintaining optimism amid adversity—are essential to meaningful political change.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Florida represents a symbolic refuge from political exhaustion and a return to foundational purpose.",
