    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 84417,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84417.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "We broke down the spending bill on yesterday's program, Kat. And, uh, well, spending might be the wrong word, aid package as it left the house. I want to give you the opportunity just real quickly. Go through the individual parts of that and why you voted the way you voted.",
