        "text": "The speaker’s definition of 'good conservative' includes valuing legislative amendment processes.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members recognize the distinction between suspension and regular order procedures.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that procedural transparency and participation are important values in congressional debate.",
