        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience shares the speaker's view that blocking a rule is a viable strategy to prevent a bill from advancing.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Amending a bill increases legitimacy and accountability in policymaking.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that their interpretation of Republican unity and strategic action is accurate and shared by others.",
        "confidence": 0.86
