  {
    "episode_id": 84417,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/4/84417.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 39,
    "turn_text": "So without naming any individual names at this point, because that's not good for you and it's not helpful in the process that you have to live and work in. How to explain how Republicans are supposed, that's supposed to be the second or first biggest issue in 2024, the southern border and the economy. How is it that Republicans are not in unanimity on the need to fix the southern border?",
